 we could see some hangover in Q1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/28/amkor-technology-inc-amkr-q3-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"AMKR 2019 Q3","e":"amkr","d":"2019-10-28","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Randy Abrams","x":"Yeah and that's a good segue, just the question I wanted to ask because now it seems like the tariffs kind of moved to consumer, if they're on-again, off-again for December.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/28/amkor-technology-inc-amkr-q3-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"AMKR 2019 Q3","e":"amkr","d":"2019-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Megan Faust","x":"As a result of our cost reduction measures, only 30% of the third quarter year-over-year revenue decline dropped through to gross profit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/28/amkor-technology-inc-amkr-q3-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"AMKR 2019 Q4","e":"amkr","d":"2020-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Megan Faust","x":"The increase from Q4 is primarily due to restructuring costs in Japan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/10/amkor-technology-inc-amkr-q4-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"AMKR 2020 Q1","e":"amkr","d":"2020-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Megan Faust","x":"This is primarily due to lower travel and other discretionary spending as well as lower than expected restructuring charges in Japan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/28/amkor-technology-inc-amkr-q1-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"AMKR 2020 Q1","e":"amkr","d":"2020-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Megan Faust","x":"We expect Q2 operating expenses of around $105 million, which includes an estimate for restructuring costs in Japan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/28/amkor-technology-inc-amkr-q1-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"AMKR 2020 Q2","e":"amkr","d":"2020-07-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Randy Abrams","x":"And there has also been from the pass-through the margin impact.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/27/amkor-technology-inc-amkr-q2-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"AMKR 2020 Q2","e":"amkr","d":"2020-07-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Megan Faust","x":"We expect Q3 operating expenses of around $110 million, which includes approximately $10 million for restructuring cost in Japan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/27/amkor-technology-inc-amkr-q2-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"AMKR 2020 Q2","e":"amkr","d":"2020-07-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Megan Faust","x":"Our Japan restructuring initiative includes a streamlining of operations and the closure of one factory.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/27/amkor-technology-inc-amkr-q2-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"AMKR 2020 Q3","e":"amkr","d":"2020-10-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Megan Faust","x":"And our focus on cost control has also resulted in relatively flat SG&A expense, excluding restructuring charges, over the past five years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/26/amkor-technology-inc-amkr-q3-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AMKR 2020 Q3","e":"amkr","d":"2020-10-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Megan Faust","x":"Q3 operating expenses were $114 million, including $6 million for restructuring costs in Japan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/26/amkor-technology-inc-amkr-q3-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AMKR 2020 Q4","e":"amkr","d":"2021-02-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Megan Faust","x":"The combination of high utilization and benefits from our Japan restructuring drove gross margin to over 20%, our best quarterly performance in four years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/09/amkor-technology-inc-amkr-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AMKR 2020 Q4","e":"amkr","d":"2021-02-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Megan Faust","x":"We substantially completed our restructuring in Japan, which is expected to reduce manufacturing costs by $25 million annually.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/09/amkor-technology-inc-amkr-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AMKR 2021 Q1","e":"amkr","d":"2021-04-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Giel Rutten","x":"So on very rare occasions we will do that, but in general we don't tactically use price increases other than increases for material price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/26/amkor-technology-inc-amkr-q1-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"AMKR 2025 Q2","e":"amkr","d":"2025-07-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Giel Rutten","x":"Our customers span the full compute ecosystem, from CPUs, GPUs, and AI accelerators to memory, networking, and peripherals.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/amkor-amkr-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AMKR 2025 Q2","e":"amkr","d":"2025-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Megan Faust","x":"In addition, we're also looking to raise prices for those customers that might be running very low volumes in order to manage profitability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/amkor-amkr-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AMKR 2025 Q2","e":"amkr","d":"2025-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Megan Faust","x":"I did want to remind you, though, that we had executed on a restructuring activity in Japan several years ago during the prior downturn.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/amkor-amkr-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AMKR 2025 Q2","e":"amkr","d":"2025-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Megan Faust","x":"And over a multiyear period, we were able to successfully close three locations and consolidate business reducing headcount and manufacturing costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/amkor-amkr-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AMKR 2025 Q4","e":"amkr","d":"2026-02-09","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Kevin Engel","x":"We have two additional programs in final qualification for HDFO supporting AI data centers, in addition to the two HDFO PC devices we've discussed previously.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/09/amkor-amkr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AMKR 2025 Q4","e":"amkr","d":"2026-02-09","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Megan Faust","x":"Computing revenue increased 6% year on year in the fourth quarter and 16% for the full year, driven by strength in AI-related PC devices and networking infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/09/amkor-amkr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AMKR 2025 Q4","e":"amkr","d":"2026-02-09","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Randy Abrams","x":"I think first, just into the first quarter, is that the leverage effect in the one-time coming out for the lower guide for Q1?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/09/amkor-amkr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AMKR 2026 Q1","e":"amkr","d":"2026-04-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Megan Faust","x":"Record revenue within AI data center applications was driven by broad-based strength across multiple customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/27/amkor-amkr-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AMKR 2026 Q3","e":"amkr","d":"2026-10-26","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Kevin Engel","x":"Customer engagement is particularly strong in next-generation AI infrastructure with additional advanced packaging opportunities developing across traditional data center, PC applications and automotive.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/26/amkor-amkr-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AMKR 2026 Q3","e